WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:11.670
Continue only after review. Open the commitment step after understanding the asset, rights, risks and evidence status.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:19.420
Choose an illustrative amount. The amount is used only to demonstrate the workflow; no payment or investment is created.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:27.170
Confirm comprehension. Acknowledge the rights, liquidity limits and dependence on rent actually received.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:34.920
Review the resulting record. The receipt links the amount, disclosure version and audit reference in the demonstration environment.
